description:
@bbmp
The garbage collection vendor has not been picking up the dry waste from our premises since over a week now. We segregate diligently but only wet waste gets picked up - probably because there is no incentive for him to pick up dry waste. 

Please he

BBMP Garbage collection vehicles not coming/Not collecting garbage

 @BBMP, Even after lot of regular complaints &amp; calls to the BBMP, we do not see any difference in the situation with respect to the garbage collection in 1st main meenakshi layout G.R homes rayasandra .

Its really sad &amp; irresponsible,even after we residents are paying the garbage collection amount regularly,we have to repeatedly face these situations where we have remind/call &amp; beg the BBMP garbage collection personnel to come &amp; collect the garbage.

We are doing our best in segregating the wet &amp; dry trash but that would still take some time from our side but if BBMP GC team cannot collect the trash itself regularly we are left with no good options.

People are paying Swachh bharat cess also now,If BBMP CG team do not take this initiative seriously who else will???
@BBMP requesting you please act on this issue at the earliest.

@BBMP, it is also my sincere request to educate the people in the area on waste trashing &amp; about keeping premises clean as i can see other residents are trashing the garbage on the roads making the roads look so ugly &amp; unclean.

Thanks
SJ

This is the 3rd time I've registered a complaint about the garbage collection issue in ward no.55 (J.C. Layout, P.F.Compount Devasandra) and every time they close it without resolving it. Please resolve this issue ASAP.

For your reference;
1st Complaint# 10954403 raised on 11th Jan-2020 and 2nd Complaint# 10955014 raised on 14-Jan-2020 both were closed without resolving.
